From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 18:53:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04905/11362] [outer-loop] ARC action-budget profile:
 exploration-phase no-op rates (10 games)

Finding: click-based games waste 29-100% of exploration actions on no-ops (frame
unchanged; ar25 96%, sk48 100%, m0r0 58%, cd82 38%); movement games ~0%. Median
33% no-op. The submitted agent config has frame_change_prune_threshold=None (no-op
pruning OFF) -> large untapped efficiency headroom on click games. development_proxy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
